I've updated your project to integrate the native libraries for the emulators. Here's what I've done:

1. Updated the CMakeLists.txt to include the native emulator cores (mGBA, Snes9x, melonDS)
2. Modified the emulator implementation files to handle rendering properly and avoid blue/yellow screens
3. Updated the build.gradle to enable CMake builds
